 In recent years, we've seen behaviour from large accounting, auditing and consulting firms in Australia that is not fair or honest. This bill represents a major development in the setting and maintenance of standards. The amendments on which we seek the House's concurrence are all consistent with the policy intent of the bill. I commend the bill to the House. Tony Burke I move that the question be put. Milton Dick The question is that the question be put.","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-representatives-10508","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/representatives/2026-06-30/5"}
